<title>INDIA: India approves IRFC $150 mln FRN issue.</title>
<headline>India approves IRFC $150 mln FRN issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Finance Ministry has permitted the state-run Indian Railway Finance Corp (IRFC) to raise $150 million through a floating rate note (FRN) issue, a government spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Railway Ministry spokesman said ANZ Grindlays Bank had been appointed banking agent for the issue.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91 11 301 2024</p>
</text>
